import{_ as a,o as t,c as n,a2 as i}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 143 | Realm Refinement · Boundary-Breaking Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 143 | Realm Refinement · Boundary-Breaking Realm · Male Human Cultivation Path","no":143,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Boundary-Breaking Realm","Human Race","Male","Sacred Cultivation Four Realms","Cultivation Path"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","17-Plane Transcendent Standard","28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0143_模块1-破界境-男性人族修炼路径.md","filePath":"en/0143_模块1-破界境-男性人族修炼路径.md"}'),o={name:"en/0143_模块1-破界境-男性人族修炼路径.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,h,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[i('<h1 id="entry-143-boundary-breaking-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" tabindex="-1">Entry 143 | Boundary-Breaking Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-143-boundary-breaking-realm-male-human-cultivation-path-pain-points-and-breakthrough-features" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 143 | Boundary-Breaking Realm: Male Human Cultivation Path, Pain Points, and Breakthrough Features&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 14, 17, 28</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-first-threshold-of-sacred-cultivation-from-attaining-dao-within-the-boundary-to-standing-across-boundaries" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The first threshold of sacred cultivation, from &quot;attaining Dao within the boundary&quot; to &quot;standing across boundaries&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-first-threshold-of-sacred-cultivation-from-attaining-dao-within-the-boundary-to-standing-across-boundaries" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The first threshold of sacred cultivation, from &quot;attaining Dao within the boundary&quot; to &quot;standing across boundaries&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s nine-realm system, the Boundary-Breaking Realm is the seventh realm and the first gate of the &quot;four sacred-cultivation realms.&quot; Per the Unified Cultivation Realm Classification (Document 14), the first five realms (Sense through Dao) are mortal cultivation; the cultivator always polishes themselves within this cosmos&#39; legal framework; from the sixth realm Dao Integration onward enters sacred cultivation, while the Boundary-Breaking Realm truly requires the cultivator to <strong>break through plane-law limits and travel cross-plane without anchor support</strong>. This is a qualitative watershed: no matter how strong a mortal cultivator is, he remains a person within the boundary; only a boundary-breaker gets the first pass toward the plane-level stage.</p><p>At this moment the six top-level axioms running through the whole text must be restated — the anti-predation axiom, the republican axiom of Myriad Races, the collective ascension axiom, the causal self-discipline axiom, and the law-first axiom. The Boundary-Breaking Realm is dangerous precisely because it, for the first time, hands &quot;cross-plane operation rights&quot; to the individual: without the five axioms as backstop, boundary-breaking power immediately degenerates into the predatory faction&#39;s &quot;cross-plane harvesting&quot;; with the five axioms, boundary-breaking becomes a transportation network shared by all Myriad Races. This entry focuses on the complete portrait of male humans in the Boundary-Breaking Realm: path, pain points, breakthrough features, and why males most easily take the fork in this realm; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-boundary-breaking-realm" tabindex="-1">I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Boundary-Breaking Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-portrait-of-male-humans-in-the-boundary-breaking-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Portrait of Male Humans in the Boundary-Breaking Realm&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The physical stamina, willpower, and deduction ability male humans built in the five mortal realms become a double-edged sword in the Boundary-Breaking Realm. Per Human Positioning and Traits (Document 51), humans are adaptable and good at collaboration; on this foundation, male individuals commonly show:</p><ul><li>Naturally sensitive to &quot;boundaries, limits, breakthrough&quot;; likes challenging rules; has an impulse to &quot;rip the plane membrane open and see&quot;</li><li>Clear authoritarian tendency; in cross-plane missions, prone to deciding on one&#39;s own, treating filing as a burden</li><li>Strong in breakthrough engineering, suited for hard work like opening plane channels and repairing rifts</li><li>Strong competitive desire; after boundary-breaking, prone to treating &quot;I can go where others cannot&quot; as identity capital</li></ul><p>The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s handling of this endowment is not suppression, but <strong>targeted guidance</strong>: male humans in the Boundary-Breaking Realm are best suited for plane-channel engineering positions in the Spatial Law Dispatch System (Origin Three-Basic Set #3), converting the &quot;impulse to tear boundaries&quot; into &quot;road-building, road-mending, road-management&quot; public service, anti-energy-waste at the root.</p><h2 id="ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-dao-integration-to-boundary-breaking" tabindex="-1">II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Dao Integration to Boundary-Breaking <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-cultivation-path-complete-chain-from-dao-integration-to-boundary-breaking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Cultivation Path: Complete Chain from Dao Integration to Boundary-Breaking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Boundary-Breaking Realm is not achieved in one leap; its standard chain is already specified in Document 14, with four milestones:</p><ol><li><strong>Law decoupling training</strong>: on the basis of Dao Integration&#39;s heaven-human unity, practice letting the personal Dao temporarily &quot;partially detach&quot; from this cosmos&#39; legal framework, understanding the elasticity of law boundaries</li><li><strong>Plane-membrane perception</strong>: able to perceive the structure, thickness, and weak points of the plane membrane, distinguishing the interfaces between material planes, energy layers, and consciousness domains</li><li><strong>Anchor-free travel drill</strong>: first under anchor guardianship, then without anchor support, complete short-distance cross-plane travel and safely return</li><li><strong>Channel operation certification</strong>: obtain formal authority to open temporary plane channels, identify and repair plane rifts</li></ol><p>For male humans, the path design must actively hedge three tendencies: first, &quot;greedy for distance&quot; — having just learned short-distance travel, wanting to cross large plane clusters; second, &quot;greedy for speed&quot; — skipping plane-membrane perception and forcefully ripping, leaving law trauma; third, &quot;greedy for solitude&quot; — refusing to travel with anchor supervision. The Boundary-Breaking Realm certification (Document 14 anchor automatic monitoring + Standard Committee assessment + thirty-day publicity) examines these three item by item, eliminating &quot;crossing boundaries with illness.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-cross-plane-shortcut-inner-demon" tabindex="-1">III. Pain Points and Costs: The Cross-Plane Shortcut Inner Demon <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-pain-points-and-costs-the-cross-plane-shortcut-inner-demon" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Pain Points and Costs: The Cross-Plane Shortcut Inner Demon&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Boundary-Breaking Realm is the first major eruption of the sentient-origin greed-shortcut inner demon at the sacred stage. Male humans&#39; typical pain points:</p><ul><li><strong>Resource temptation</strong>: discovering rich plane resources after crossing boundaries, getting the idea of &quot;quietly taking without filing&quot; — this is precisely the &quot;disturbing causality&quot; the causal self-discipline axiom explicitly forbids</li><li><strong>Loneliness deification</strong>: walking alone across planes for a long time produces a &quot;I am above all beings&quot; mindset, sliding into the enlightened predator&#39;s psychological soil</li><li><strong>Law rejection</strong>: different planes&#39; law environments differ wildly; forceful adaptation causes rejection reactions between the personal domain&#39;s laws and outside laws</li><li><strong>Disconnection risk</strong>: one calculation error in anchor-free travel may cause loss between plane rifts; precedents exist in history</li></ul><p>Breakthrough costs are equally real: forceful boundary-breaking tears the personal domain; at minimum the domain collapses and must be rebuilt, at worst the soul is flung into plane gaps. The Alaya Network and multi-layer supervision for the first time comprehensively intervene in this realm — cross-plane operations strictly filed, observe-first then limited interference, only relaying knowledge not disturbing causality. This is not binding the strongman, but protecting the strongman himself from being backlashed by his own ambition.</p><h2 id="iv-breakthrough-features-from-boundary-grandmaster-to-plane-level-power" tabindex="-1">IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Boundary Grandmaster&quot; to &quot;Plane-Level Power&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-breakthrough-features-from-boundary-grandmaster-to-plane-level-power" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Breakthrough Features: From &quot;Boundary Grandmaster&quot; to &quot;Plane-Level Power&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Markers for male humans who successfully break the boundary and formally enter the ranks of plane-level power:</p><ul><li><strong>Stable anchor-free travel</strong>: able to anchor-free travel and safely return in any known plane cluster</li><li><strong>Operable plane membrane</strong>: able to precisely open channels and mend rifts, not crudely tear</li><li><strong>High-dimensionalized life form</strong>: able to survive simultaneously in material plane, energy layer, and consciousness domain law environments</li><li><strong>Domain outward expansion</strong>: personal domain can expand into a small independent space, possessing the rudiment of the World-Creation Realm</li></ul><p>Breakthrough is not the endpoint. Above the Boundary-Breaking Realm, the World-Creation Realm requires the cultivator to evolve from &quot;can walk&quot; to &quot;can create worlds.&quot; And a boundary-breaker with pure foundation and full filing has already become the backbone of the 20% Activation Strategy at the cross-plane level.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: male engineering breakthrough force and breakthrough desire are channeled into plane transportation network construction, not for monopolizing a single plane</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: boundary-breaking authority is not tied to predatory resource extraction; crossing boundaries only builds roads, does not harvest</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: in the old system, strong ones &quot;able to cross boundaries&quot; were often overlords swallowing plane resources alone; Heng Yuan Zhou hands cross-plane rights to regulated public positions, eliminating intra-boundary monopoly</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: male humans are only one kind of boundary-breaker; wood tribe, spirit tribe, planetary consciousness also walk this cross-boundary road (see Entry 146)</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: Boundary-Breaking Realm methods and channel maps are publicly networked, a link in the &quot;basic methods → Dao sacrifice → multiverse level → Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&quot; fully open chain</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Boundary-Breaking Realm is the gate where male humans for the first time extend their &quot;personal Dao&quot; into cosmic public space. In the predatory system, this step means becoming a plane overlord; in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, this step means becoming a builder and guardian of plane transportation. Once the cross-boundary step carries filing and responsibility, boundary-breaking is no longer destroying boundaries, but opening the blood vessels of Myriad Race symbiosis.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standard</a> · <a href="./28-跨位面锚点连接.html">28-Cross-Plane Anchor Connection</a> · <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=a(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
